  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aid Children&apos;s Health &amp; Education in 5 Countries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CHW supports locally-run education, health, welfare and poverty-relief programmes for children and youth in Argentina, China, Ghana, Romania and South Africa. As well as the usual, ongoing needs, we have also been responding to the pandemic, the Ukraine refugee crisis and the cost of living crisis. As a small charity, it is challenging to keep up with this level of need. This project will allow your donations to go to where they will make the greatest impact for the children at our projects.</narrative>
  </description>
